['Let R(s)=−s+as²+bs³+O(s⁴), with a,b real. A local map is tangent to a flip at zero because R′(0)=−1.','The second iterate is R∘R. A bifurcation additionally needs a parameter family and a transversality condition; a fixed jet alone provides neither.'],
