'a²=1.61671225, so a²+b=1.74641225 and the second-iterate cubic coefficient is −3.4928245. The listed fourth and fifth coefficients do not affect this cubic calculation. At s=0.001 the predicted deviation R²(s)−s is approximately −3.4928245×10⁻⁹ before higher-order corrections.',
