['Consider F(x,y)=(ax,by+cx²), where 0<b<a<1. Seek an analytic invariant graph y=h(x) with h(0)=h′(0)=0.','Graph invariance is h(ax)=bh(x)+cx². Nonresonance for an analytic scalar graph is a^k≠b for every integer k≥2.'],
