['Use (J_dx)_i=x_(i+d)−x_i on a connected cyclic design. In each family d, take a constant target b_(d,i)=β_d and a constant positive weight w_d.','Minimize E(x)=1/2 Σ_(d,i)w_d((J_dx)_i−β_d)² over Σx_i=0.'],
